==Requirements==
Player must complete [[Quest:Committed to the Plan]] in order to do [[Quest:Ruined Return]]
==To Start==
Speak with [[Noggle Cogloose]] located in [[Noggle's Retreat]], [[Sunstone Valley]].
==Goals==
Noggle has sent you to a dwarven dig site in Sunstone Valley to deliver a package.
*Deliver the package to Sarkin Stonehearth
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Noggle Cogloose]] located in [[Noggle's Retreat]], [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"The Legendary Sunstone may have eluded me today, but it won’t elude me for long!<br />In the meantime, could you <font color='#D9781A'>take this care package</font> to the nice <font color='D9781A'>dwarves</font> down the road? Also, try not to mention anything about how I converted their equipment into jump pads." -Noggle Cogloose
#Speak with [[Sarkin Stonehearth]] located in [[The Dig]], [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"Listen stranger, if you’re here to cause trouble you can turn yourself around right now...<br />Oh, you brought a package?<br />Uh, this is just a bunch of junk. Where did you even get this? Actually, never mind, I don’t think I want to know." -Sarkin Stonehearth
#*"Thanks!" -Player response
